WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Project chat. A chat room per project, so conversation sits next to the work.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: kickoff notes; quick questions.

3
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.890
(Note: Milo's message was posted from his own account before the recording.) Each project has its own chat — open it from the header.

4
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.810
Type a message…

5
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.770
…and press Enter to send.

6
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:24.770
There's no message box: You're a Viewer in this workspace. Teammates' messages appear late: The server may not have realtime configured; messages still arrive on refresh.

7
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:29.270
One chat per project
